uncement/publication.aspx?name=SAP10088","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44760","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-20017","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-20017.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2016/20xxx/CVE-2016-20017.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2016-20017.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2016/20xxx/CVE-2016-20017.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2016/CVE-2016-20017/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-20017.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2016.txt","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/103ce582d506bd03c5888b333c9c01b846bc9f13/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-20017.yaml","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-20017.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0168.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0168.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0108","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-11021","title":"D-Link DCS-930L 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"D-Link DCS-930L 网络摄像头存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78），设备固件版本低于 2.12 时，远程攻击者可通过向 setSystemCommand 接口的 SystemCommand 参数注入恶意操作系统命令，以设备 root 权限执行任意命令。攻击者需具备设备管理后台的认证权限，但利用难度较低，成功利用后可完全控制设备，进而用于构建僵尸网络或窃取监控数据。该漏洞已公开 Exploit-DB 利用代码（ID: 39437），实际攻击风险较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2016-11021"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-09T01:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:40:49Z","remediation":"将 D-Link DCS-930L 设备固件升级至 2.12 或更高版本。如无法升级，在设备管理界面中禁用远程 Web 管理功能，并在网络防火墙中限制仅内网可信 IP 访问设备管理端口（80/443），同时避免将设备直接暴露在公网。此外，定期检查并修改设备管理员密码，防止攻击者通过弱口令获得高权限后利用该命令注入漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39437","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-11021","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-11021.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2016/11xxx/CVE-2016-11021.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-11021.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2016/11xxx/CVE-2016-11021.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-11021.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/PaloAltoNetworks/Unit42-timely-threat-intel/blob/5d1a9bb15da5a13806165e6109534b7ddd0eec8c/2026-05-28-TuxBot-v3-Evolution-Framework-Analysis.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-11021.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2016/CVE-2016-11021.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0108.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0108.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0053","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10993","title":"WordPress ScoreMe 主题跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 ScoreMe 主题（2016-04-01 及之前版本）存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（XSS），由于对搜索参数 `s` 的输入过滤不严，攻击者可将恶意 JavaScript 代码注入 URL 中。当已登录的低权限用户点击特制链接时，恶意脚本会在用户浏览器中执行，可能导致会话 Cookie 窃取、页面内容篡改或重定向至钓鱼站点。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危，需用户交互触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10993"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-17T15:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:40:46Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于 ScoreMe 主题未对 `s` 参数进行过滤导致反射型 XSS。由于该主题自 2016 年后已停止更新维护，建议立即更换为官方仍在维护的 WordPress 主题（如 Twenty Twenty-Four）。如无法更换主题，可编辑主题的 `search.php` 文件，对 `$_GET['s']` 参数使用 `esc_html()` 或 `wp_kses_post()` 函数进行输出转义处理，同时在 WordPress 后台「设置→讨论」中关闭「使用关键词搜索」功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8431","https://www.vulnerability-lab.com/get_content.php?id=1808","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10993.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10993.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2016/CVE-2016-10993.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10993.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-10993.js","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-10993_6.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-10993_2.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2016/CVE-2016-10993.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2016-10993.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2016-10993-2768.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/18/xssArtifact/xssReport.csv","https://github.com/0xc4t/CVE-2016-10993"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0052","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10976","title":"WordPress Safe Editor插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 安全编辑器插件（Safe Editor）1.2 版本之前存在跨站脚本漏洞。该插件在保存编辑器内容时未对用户输入进行身份验证和过滤，导致攻击者可通过向未经验证的 se_save 接口提交特制的恶意载荷，在管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时执行任意 JavaScript 代码。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，可窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或进行钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响所有使用 Safe Editor 1.2 之前版本的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10976"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-17T15:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:40:44Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 安全编辑器插件 safe-editor 升级到 1.2 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在 WordPress 后台禁用该插件，并审查所有已发布内容中是否已嵌入恶意脚本，清除后重新保存。同时建议安装 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截 XSS 攻击载荷作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/safe-editor/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8497","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10976.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10976.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10976.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2016/10xxx/CVE-2016-10976.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-10976.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-10976_6.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-10976_2.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2016-10976.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a80bd76288fa21ed6722e02a392df422512b32df/2016/CVE-2016-10976.json","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-10976-67cbd1105c59b1d13b46ca13d1f71410.yaml","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/CVE-2016-10976-67cbd1105c59b1d13b46ca13d1f71410.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0052.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0052.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0051","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10973","title":"WordPress Brafton插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Brafton 插件 3.4.8 之前版本中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞，该漏洞位于 wp-admin/admin.php?page=BraftonArticleLoader 页面的 tab 参数中，未对用户输入进行充分过滤和转义。攻击者可构造恶意 URL 诱导已登录管理员点击，在目标浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，窃取会话 Cookie 或执行恶意操作。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10973"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-16T17:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:40:43Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress Brafton 插件至 3.4.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 wp-admin/admin.php 页面 tab 参数跨站脚本漏洞。如无法立即升级，可限制对 wp-admin 目录的访问权限或使用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截包含恶意 tab 参数的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8614","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/05/20/5","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10973.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10973.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10973.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2016/10xxx/CVE-2016-10973.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-10973.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-10973-a63a884ac6fdf6350fe7b261f973b061.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2016-10973.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/aced02b678cc4062da6e11482c0850c64f73ef89/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-109xx/CVE-2016-10973.json","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/909b4fa12b2b4ab28f68b284a6dbb599f100e425/data/lists/NucleiList.txt","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-10973_49.yaml","https://github.com/liqzz/vultrap/blob/10d370464af2a0b2f4966e5a301f3db88b43ca26/rules/nuclei/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10973.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0050","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10972","title":"WordPress newspaper theme 权限访问控制缺失漏洞","description":"WordPress Newspaper 主题（tagDiv 主题）6.7.2 之前版本中存在权限管理不当漏洞，其 `td_ajax_update_panel` AJAX 处理函数未对用户身份进行有效验证，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接向该接口发送特制请求，修改主题面板中的任意选项配置，包括插入恶意 JavaScript 代码或修改站点关键设置。攻击者无需任何权限，仅需目标站点安装并启用受影响版本的主题即可实施攻击，可能导致完全接管网站控制权。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10972"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-16T17:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:40:43Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress newspaper 主题升级至 6.7.2 或更高版本。该漏洞源于 td_ajax_update_panel 函数缺乏权限检查，允许未认证攻击者远程执行任意代码。升级后请清除 WordPress 缓存并验证后台面板功能正常。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 newspaper 主题或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截对 /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php 中 td_ajax_update_panel 动作的未授权请求作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8852","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39894","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10972.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10972.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10972.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2016/10xxx/CVE-2016-10972.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-10972-e07936b625a878be880bb5cde344c7e8.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-10972_2.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2016/CVE-2016-10972.json","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/65dd96623246c3767e98237d690efc4c56ec7044/reports/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10972.md","https://github.com/lxyeternal/IntelliRadar/blob/a0c9548f19182a7b80f26a7191b2f4f015c404ff/Dataset/Content/bleepingcomputer_new/20241220_132907_797908.txt","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-10972_11.yaml","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2016/10xxx/CVE-2016-10972.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0050.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0050.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0049","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10960","title":"WordPress wsecure插件 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WordPress wsecure 插件 2.4 之前版本中存在远程代码执行漏洞，该插件在 wsecure-config.php 文件的 publish 参数中未对用户输入进行有效过滤，导致攻击者可通过在参数中注入 shell 元字符实现远程命令执行。攻击者需拥有 WordPress 后台的发布权限（低权限），无需用户交互即可通过网络远程触发。成功利用该漏洞可导致目标网站被完全控制，造成数据泄露、网站篡改等严重后果。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10960"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-16T13:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:40:42Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress wsecure 插件升级至 2.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 wsecure-config.php 中 publish 参数未正确过滤 shell 元字符导致的远程代码执行漏洞。如无法升级，可删除或重命名 wsecure 插件目录下的 wsecure-config.php 文件，并禁用该插件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/wsecure/#developers","https://www.pluginvulnerabilities.com/2016/07/12/remote-code-execution-rce-vulnerability-in-wsecure-lite/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10960.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10960.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10960.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2016-10960-2767.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2016-10960.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2016/CVE-2016-10960.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2016-10960-2763.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-10960_1.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2016-10960-2763.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2016-10960-2765.yaml","https://github.com/ramvalyalal/Repo/blob/7bfba96d14b622f0007d63db4bb89e6b1b532b3f/Project/Templates/cve-2016-10960-2763.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0049.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0049.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0048","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10956","title":"WordPress mail-masta插件本地文件包含漏洞","description":"WordPress mail-masta 插件 1.0 版本中存在输入验证错误漏洞，该插件中的 `count_of_send.php` 和 `csvexport.php` 两个文件未对用户传入的文件路径参数进行有效过滤，导致远程攻击者可在无需认证的情况下，通过构造包含路径遍历序列（如 `../`）的特制请求，实现本地文件包含攻击，从而读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如 `/etc/passwd`、`wp-config.php` 等）。该漏洞影响 WordPress mail-masta 插件 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10956"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-16T12:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:40:41Z","remediation":"该插件已于 2014 年 9 月从 WordPress 官方仓库下架且不再维护，建议立即从 WordPress 后台插件管理中删除 mail-masta 插件，并替换为其他仍在维护的邮件营销插件（如 MailPoet 或 Newsletter）。同时检查服务器上是否存在该插件的残留文件（如 wp-content/plugins/mail-masta/），手动删除以彻底消除本地文件包含风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","reference