rder参数处。具有管理员权限的认证攻击者可通过向受影响插件发送特制的HTTP请求，利用order参数注入恶意SQL语句，从而获取数据库中的敏感信息（如用户凭证、配置数据等）。由于该插件未对用户输入进行充分的过滤和转义处理，导致攻击者能够操纵数据库查询。该漏洞影响WordPress zm-gallery插件1.0版本，CVSS评分7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10940"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-13T12:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:40:39Z","remediation":"立即在 WordPress 后台停用并删除 zm-gallery 插件 1.0 版本，该插件已长期无人维护且从官方仓库下架。改用其他仍在维护的 WordPress 相册插件（如 NextGEN Gallery 或 Modula）作为替代。同时检查网站近期是否有因该漏洞导致的数据泄露或数据库篡改痕迹。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lenonleite.com.br/en/2016/12/16/zm-gallery-1-plugin-wordpress-blind-injection/","https://wordpress.org/plugins/zm-gallery/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10940.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10940.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10940.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/CVE-2016-10940/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2016-10940.py","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2016/CVE-2016-10940-zm_gallery-9e56e1fe-bb53-422c-9219-b79e24f0f915.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9b8adc91044a77d53b1bed8336bdfa6b10497eca/2016/CVE-2016-10940.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-10940_2.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2016-10940-2757.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-10940_13.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2016-10940-2756.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2016/CVE-2016-10940.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0046","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10924","title":"WordPress ebook-download插件路径遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress ebook-download 插件（版本 < 1.2）存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含 `../` 等路径穿越序列的特制 URL 请求，绕过文件访问限制，读取服务器上任意文件（如 wp-config.php 等敏感配置文件），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需任何权限或用户交互，仅需目标站点安装并启用受影响版本的插件即可利用。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 1.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10924"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-22T14:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:40:37Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress ebook-download 插件升级至 1.2 或更高版本。该漏洞在 1.2 版本中已修复，升级后可消除目录遍历风险，防止攻击者通过构造恶意路径读取服务器上任意文件。如无法升级，可暂时禁用该插件并替换为其他电子书下载插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/ebook-download/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10924.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10924.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2016/CVE-2016-10924.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10924.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-10924.js","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2016-10924-2753.yaml","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/af3559bbe0fed7cff369cd3b408943f3531af5f3/2016/CVE-2016-10924.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-10924_3.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2016-10924-ebook_download-07aee46a-a32d-4d31-9541-4e183299b09c.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/CVE-2016-10924/poc/nuclei/CVE-2016-10924.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2016-10924_3.yaml","https://github.com/rvzsec/CVE-2016-10924","https://github.com/alealeluyah/cve-2016-10924-POC","https://github.com/LGenAgul/Wordpress-ebook-CVE-2016-10924"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0063","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-4975","title":"Apache HTTP Server CRLF注入漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 的 mod_userdir 模块存在 CRLF 注入漏洞，攻击者可通过向使用该模块的站点发送特制请求，在 HTTP 响应头中注入换行符，从而实现 HTTP 响应拆分攻击。该漏洞允许攻击者利用响应拆分进行缓存投毒、跨站脚本攻击等进一步危害。攻击者需要诱导用户访问恶意构造的链接，影响版本为 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.1 至 2.4.23 以及 2.2.0 至 2.2.31。Apache 已在 2.4.25 和 2.2.32 版本中通过禁止在 Location 及其他响应头键值中注入 CR 或 LF 字符修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-4975"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-14T12:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:48:32Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.4.25+（2.4.x 分支）或 2.2.32+（2.2.x 分支），禁止 Location 等响应头中出现 CR（\\r）或 LF（\\n）字符。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面对响应头进行 CRLF 过滤，拦截包含 %0d%0a 的请求参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105093","https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_22.html#CVE-2016-4975","https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html#CVE-2016-4975","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/56c2e7cc9deb1c12a843d0dc251ea7fd3e7e80293cde02fcd65286ba%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","h