073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-8527","title":"Aruba AirWave VisualRF 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Aruba AirWave 管理平台 VisualRF 组件存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者可通过向已登录的管理员用户发送特制链接，诱使其点击后，恶意脚本将在用户浏览器中执行，导致攻击者能够窃取会话 Cookie、登录凭据等敏感信息。该漏洞影响 AirWave 8.2.3.1 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可发起攻击，但需要目标管理员用户在同一浏览器中已登录 AirWave 并点击恶意链接。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。HPE Aruba 已在 AirWave 8.2.3.1 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-8527"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-06T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:54:29Z","remediation":"升级 Aruba AirWave 至 8.2.3.1 或更高版本以修复 VisualRF 组件中的反射型 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，过滤 VisualRF 页面 URL 参数中的恶意脚本关键字（如 &lt;script&gt;、onerror= 等），并限制 AirWave 管理界面仅允许受信任 IP 访问，降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.arubanetworks.com/assets/alert/ARUBA-PSA-2017-001.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96495","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41482/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41482","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-8527.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2016/CVE-2016-8527.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-8527.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-8527.js","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-8527-2819.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2016/8xxx/CVE-2016-8527.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md","https://github.com/westonsteimel/national-vulnerability-database/blob/9384797ef3f6cbce77f8f77a526023fdae6ccd76/data/2016/CVE-2016-8527.json","https://github.com/mrhenrike/EmbedXPL-Forge/blob/55da15272f066aa9d0dde3f336f7d474e1